The Constitution text is copied from the UAE Legislation portal (https://uaelegislation.gov.ae), the UAE federal
government legislation site, Arabic page legislations/1000, via an Internet Archive capture of 29 May 2025. The
portal states no reuse licence; its live terms could not be read from here (the site is behind a bot challenge).

Basis for reuse. Federal Decree-Law No. 38 of 2021 on Copyright and Neighbouring Rights, Article 3(2), removes
protection from official documents, whatever their language, such as the texts of laws, regulations, resolutions,
international conventions, judgments and decisions of administrative committees with judicial mandate. The text
is published on that basis and will be withdrawn on request.

